{"page":158,"width":1849,"height":2686,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"앞 절에서는 분할 정복을 A卜%하여 시권스에서 이진 김색을 수행하는 예를 살펴봤습니다. 이진 검","words":[{"text":"앞","x":184,"y":182,"width":32,"height":37},{"text":"절에서는","x":230,"y":177,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"분할","x":371,"y":180,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"정복을","x":451,"y":181,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"A卜%하여","x":560,"y":179,"width":128,"height":39},{"text":"시권스에서","x":704,"y":180,"width":156,"height":39},{"text":"이진","x":877,"y":182,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"김색을","x":955,"y":179,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"수행하는","x":1064,"y":180,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"예를","x":1208,"y":181,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"살펴봤습니다.","x":1284,"y":180,"width":209,"height":39},{"text":"이진","x":1511,"y":178,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"검","x":1592,"y":177,"width":28,"height":37}]},{"text":"색은 각 단계에서 전체 시권스의 일부에 대해서만 검색을 수행하며. 이 일부분의 시권스를 range","words":[{"text":"색은","x":183,"y":252,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"각","x":262,"y":249,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"단계에서","x":309,"y":248,"width":128,"height":40},{"text":"전체","x":456,"y":251,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"시권스의","x":534,"y":251,"width":128,"height":38},{"text":"일부에","x":680,"y":252,"width":92,"height":38},{"text":"대해서만","x":789,"y":253,"width":130,"height":37},{"text":"검색을","x":933,"y":253,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"수행하며.","x":1044,"y":252,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":1203,"y":253,"width":27,"height":37},{"text":"일부분의","x":1249,"y":252,"width":127,"height":38},{"text":"시권스를","x":1394,"y":253,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"range","x":1540,"y":262,"width":85,"height":26}]},{"text":"로 표현했습니다. 원소를 찾았거나 또는 더 작은 부분0 나눌 수 없을 때 검색을 종료","words":[{"text":"로","x":182,"y":328,"width":33,"height":28},{"text":"표현했습니다.","x":229,"y":321,"width":205,"height":39},{"text":"원소를","x":454,"y":323,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"찾았거나","x":567,"y":323,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"또는","x":711,"y":326,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"더","x"