":"찾","x":1589,"y":468,"width":35,"height":37}]},{"text":"을 수 있습니다. 즉, 전체의 일부에서 구한 해답이 전체에서 구한 해답과 같습니다. 그러므로","words":[{"text":"을","x":180,"y":541,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":229,"y":541,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"있습니다.","x":282,"y":539,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"즉,","x":441,"y":541,"width":42,"height":37},{"text":"전체의","x":506,"y":539,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"일부에서","x":625,"y":540,"width":127,"height":37},{"text":"구한","x":772,"y":540,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"해답이","x":856,"y":540,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"전체에서","x":973,"y":541,"width":128,"height":37},{"text":"구한","x":1121,"y":541,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"해답과","x":1205,"y":541,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"같습니다.","x":1322,"y":540,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"그러므로","x":1485,"y":540,"width":136,"height":36}]},{"text":"이 경우에는 일반적인 분할 정복 접근 방법에서 필요한 결합 과정이 필요하지 않습니다. 다만 이","words":[{"text":"이","x":182,"y":613,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"경우에는","x":227,"y":613,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"일반적인","x":374,"y":611,"width":130,"height":37},{"text":"분할","x":517,"y":612,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"정복","x":599,"y":612,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"접근","x":678,"y":612,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"방법에서","x":755,"y":611,"width":128,"height":38},{"text":"필요한","x":902,"y":612,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"결합","x":1015,"y":613,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"과정이","x":1091,"y":613,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"필요하지","x":1205,"y":612,"width":128,"height":38},{"text":"않습니다.","x":1350,"y":611,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"다만","x":1508,"y":612,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"이","x":1589,"y":612,"width":29,"height":38}]},{"text":"러한 특성은 분할 정복을 이용하여 해결할 수 있는 다수의 계산 문제에서 혼치 않은 경우입니다.","words":[{"text":"러한","x":183,"y":686,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"특성은","x":258,"y":685,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"분할","x":369,"y":684,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"정복을","x":450,"y":684,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"이용하여","x":563,"y":684,"width":1